CANVAS QUICKHACKS

EDPUZZLE SPEEDUP
1. play edpuzzle video
2. in the edpuzzle window, right/double click OR f12
3. locate console (at the bottom) and IF NECCISSARY type "allow pasting" into the next blank line
4. on a new blank line, paste "speed = 2 // Change this to the speed (eg 2 for 2x speed)
video = document.querySelector('video')
Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(HTMLMediaElement.prototype, 'playbackRate').set.call(video, speed)
Object.defineProperty(video, 'playbackRate', { writable: false })"
    - personally, the maximum speed edpuzzle can handle without ticks breaking is "4"

ACTIVITY POPUP
1. in the assignment window, right/double click OR f12
2. under the elements section (at the top) locate a line beginning with "<frame.." and hover over it to ensure it highlights the activity window
3. locate under or within the "<iframe..." line blue text that says src="..." 
4. double click the bright blue url withing the quotes following "src=" and copy it
5. in a new tab, type "https://stpius.instructure.com/" then paste that url from the elements and enter
